{
  "title": "Stinkyscape, the release: the set ships",
  "sources": "Issue #1884, the last part of #1856 (tracker #1836)",
  "notes": "The Stinkyscape set ships (R1420, R1857000): its 175 cards, the Dormant Starship and 52 tokens join every pool that names no set, the deck builder, the Almanac and random decks, while the AI's own random decks keep R1390's soft gate (AI_DECK_GATED_SETS) until issue #1885 measures the AI on the set. Its mechanics are the rulings of #1837 to #1855's phase 0 and of #1857 to #1883's parts. Core #95, Classic+ #73 and Meditative #95 link the two Stinkyscape editions their texts name (R279); Core #82 KY's Trial, which works across every set that ships (R831004), Discovers among six sets now; no other card of an earlier set changes. The voice set's budget is 16 MiB for the set's lines (R1884000).",
